  "solution": {
    "text": "If each observation is multiplied with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> &amp; then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math> is subtracted, then<br />New mean <math><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />and new standard deviation<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />If <math><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; (from equation (1))<br />If <math><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></math>"
